ShaSwap is a fully-decentralized, non-custodial, MEV-resistant batch-auction
DEX on Cardano (eUTXO), published as a hyperstructure: it has no admin keys, no
governance token, no privileged operator, and no upgrade authority. The
solver ("batcher") role is permissionless — anyone may run their own under the
terms of this License.
